WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Step 1 — Construction. Draw a light circle with your whole arm.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Add faint center lines to judge symmetry.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 2 — Decide where the light comes from: top left.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Draw the terminator, where light turns into shadow.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 3 — Block in the core shadow away from the light.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Add the cast shadow, darkest right under the sphere.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Step 4 — Blend from light to dark in smooth layers.

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep the darkest values just past the terminator.

9
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Step 5 — Lift out the highlight where light hits directly.

10
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Lighten the shadow edge for reflected light. Done!
